# Feature description: The product of nArNO2 (number of nitro aromatic groups) and C_per_N_ratio (ratio of the percentage of Carbon atoms to the number of Nitrogen atoms). Nitro groups often play a role in chemical pathways, and their interaction with carbon-to-nitrogen balance might influence biodegradability.
# Usefulness: This interaction captures more complex relationships and dependencies that single features might miss, which can enhance predictive accuracy by leveraging both structural and compositional factors.

