# Step 2: Log-Transform C_per_N_ratio to Handle Skewness
# Feature description: The logarithm of the C_per_N_ratio. Many features in the dataset are log-transformed, and C_per_N_ratio has a highly skewed range. The log-transform smoothens the distribution and increases interpretability.
